    {
     "k": "texto",
     "x": 241,
     "y": 2179,
     "w": 139,
     "h": 184,
     "html": "<ul>\n<li data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">Tipos 1&nbsp; y 2:&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">Tipos 3 y 4:&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">Tipo&nbsp; 5:&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n<li data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">Tipos 6 y 7:&nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
     "fs": 18,
     "lh": "normal",
     "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)",
     "align": "start",
     "fw": "400",
     "ls": "normal"
    },
    {
     "k": "texto",
     "x": 394,
     "y": 2179,
     "w": 961,
     "h": 161,
     "html": "<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">Sugieren estreñimiento.</p>\n\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">Generalmente representan heces formadas;&nbsp;el tipo 4 suele considerarse el patrón ideal.</p>\n\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">Heces blandas, cuya interpretación depende de la frecuencia y del contexto.</p>\n\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p data-f=\"18\" data-c=\"rgb(82, 79, 79)\" data-a=\"start\">Heces diarreicas.</p>",
     "fs": 18,
     "lh": "normal",
     "color": "rgb(82, 79, 79)",
     "align": "start",
     "fw": "400",
     "ls": "normal"
    },
